Subject: dt-bindings: media: dw9807-vcm: add the DW9817 compatible

The driver matches dongwoon,dw9817-vcm for the bidirectional DW9817 used
on the Radxa camera modules. Document it next to the DW9807.

Signed-off-by: SuperKali <hello@superkali.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/dongwoon,dw9807-vcm.yaml | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/dongwoon,dw9807-vcm.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/dongwoon,dw9807-vcm.yaml
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/dongwoon,dw9807-vcm.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/dongwoon,dw9807-vcm.yaml
@@ -16,7 +16,9 @@ description: |
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: dongwoon,dw9807-vcm
+    enum:
+      - dongwoon,dw9807-vcm
+      - dongwoon,dw9817-vcm
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
